			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<h4>Regular Maintenance</h4>
				<p>Each day you pressure wash:<br>&nbsp; Inspect, clean and replace as needed</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Engine oil level, add to when needed (gas models)</li>
					<li>Check electric cord and plug for damage (electric)</li>
					<li>Gun trigger safety</li>
				</ul>
				<p>Each week of washing:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Tip wear, replace if necessary</li>
					<li>Inspect all high pressure hoses</li>
					<li>Inspect all high pressure connections</li>
				</ul>
				<p>Annually:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Schedule a maintenance check and tune-up at an authorized repair center such as:<br>Portland Compressor<br>7440 SW Bonita Rd<br>Portland Oregon 97224</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
